; Glacial Spike. The art is tools/art/glacial_ice.py: three drawings on three rows - the spike, a
; Glacier Crown spike and Frozen Spire's pillar - each 8 frames of a 40x72 cell at x2, shown at
; scale 1 and never scaled (IceSpike picks the row). The reach is the ice the strike throws out to
; its hit radius (ImpactDebrisLayer), drawn by the code out of the radius it tests.
